                            <origDate/>
                        </origin>
                        <provenance type="found" when="1867">Macalister (1945, 293) recorded that it was discovered in 1867 by W. Williams of Dungarvan. Situated in a slight col between Carrigfenoagh Hill c. 500m to the N and a low rise c. 500m to the S. 
                        </provenance>
                        <provenance type="observed" when="2018">In situ, standing in the middle of a field on private farmland. Examined and recorded in 3d for the Ogham in 3D project in 2018.
                        </provenance>
                    </history>
